#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:16 fe7e82d18b0746208af9e15c78158e31
msgid "Global singleton that manages the FMOD audio system lifecycle."
msgstr "管理 FMOD 音频系统生命周期的全局单例"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:21 0997087d4c044f52a885bba962f06c2e
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:23 60ab98c7caf8459c81d6a02a68ea3745
msgid ""
"FmodServer is a global singleton that manages the FMOD Core API audio system within Godot. It "
"initializes and maintains the main FMOD System instance, registers performance monitors for "
"tracking CPU and file usage, manages the audio bus layout, and connects to Godot's SceneTree for "
"per-frame updates."
msgstr ""
"**FmodServer**    是一个全局单例，用于管理 Godot 中的 FMOD Core API 音频系统。它初始化并维护主 FMOD 系统实例，注册性能监控以跟踪 CPU "
"和文件使用情况，管理音频总线布局，并连接到 Godot 的   ``SceneTree``   以进行每帧更新。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:25 6dd75be8c9104880b6a92d94c5f762ef
msgid ""
"The server automatically initializes during GDExtension loading and handles all FMOD lifecycle "
"management. It creates performance monitors that can be viewed in Godot's Debugger > Monitor tab "
"to track FMOD's resource usage."
msgstr ""
"服务器在   ``GDExtension``   加载期间自动初始化，并处理所有 FMOD 生命周期管理。它创建的性能监控可以在 Godot 的调试器 > 监视器选项卡中查看，以跟踪 FMOD "
"的资源使用情况。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:27 68949bb1b983471181144f037343d57b
msgid "\\ **Performance Monitors:**"
msgstr "**性能监控：**"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:29 45fcf7d7daaa47b4ade49026d0219ef4
msgid "The following custom monitors are registered with Godot's Performance system:"
msgstr "以下自定义监控已注册到 Godot 的性能系统："

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:31 9fda7a6686c040629993a2768474f2ed
msgid "``FmodCPUUsage/DSP``: DSP processing CPU usage percentage"
msgstr "``FmodCPUUsage/DSP``   ：DSP 处理的 CPU 使用百分比"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:33 9c698915419a4f82a8750364a19707e8
msgid "``FmodCPUUsage/Stream``: Stream decoding CPU usage percentage"
msgstr "``FmodCPUUsage/Stream``：流解码的 CPU 使用百分比"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:35 0b01a44076ef426191a54c2251abf247
msgid "``FmodCPUUsage/Geometry``: 3D geometry processing CPU usage percentage"
msgstr "``FmodCPUUsage/Geometry``：三维几何处理的 CPU 使用百分比"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:37 54ae92b4ec4e4e73b6e3bd7ff852db96
msgid "``FmodCPUUsage/Update``: System update CPU usage percentage"
msgstr "``FmodCPUUsage/Update``   ：系统更新的 CPU 使用百分比"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:39 342d230cb2ce4338bbf1c6ff52fa3f33
msgid "``FmodCPUUsage/Convolution1``: Convolution reverb 1 CPU usage percentage"
msgstr "``FmodCPUUsage/Convolution1``   ：卷积混响 1 的 CPU 使用百分比"

