#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:130 6d758af0719543ed899c910c2a805ef0
msgid ""
"Returns the main FMOD System instance. This is the primary interface for creating sounds, "
"channels, DSP effects, and other FMOD objects. The system is automatically initialized during "
"server startup with settings from ProjectSettings."
msgstr "返回主要的 FMOD 系统实例。这是创建声音、通道、DSP 效果和其他 FMOD 对象的主要接口。系统在服务器启动时会根据项目设置自动初始化。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:142 c5639a3e91384acfa4054bd64cdb5b68
msgid ":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` **get_master_channel_group**\\ (\\ ) |static|"
msgstr ":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` **get_master_channel_group**\\ (\\ ) |static|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:144 af4afe77ef9742c1951bebf5ae3ae91f
msgid ""
"Returns the master channel group that all sounds route through by default. This is the root of "
"the channel group hierarchy and can be used to control global volume, pitch, and effects for all "
"playing sounds."
msgstr "返回默认情况下所有声音通过的主通道组。它是通道组层次结构的根，可以用于控制所有正在播放声音的全局音量、音高和效果。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:156 dbf952958cb949cdad13a1ad431e7149
msgid ":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` **get_audio_bus_layout**\\ (\\ ) |static|"
msgstr ":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` **get_audio_bus_layout**\\ (\\ ) |static|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodserver.rst:158 e4f1e8074f254889b1ad93cf2a1b5a8e
msgid ""
"Returns the audio bus layout used for managing audio buses and their routing. The bus layout "
"synchronizes with Godot's AudioServer bus layout and provides FMOD-specific bus functionality "
"including DSP effects."
msgstr "返回用于管理音频总线及其路由的音频总线布局。该总线布局与 Godot 的   ``AudioServer``   总线布局同步，并提供 FMOD 特定的总线功能，包括 DSP 效果。"

